{"requirements":[{"id":"R1","requirement":"The repaired export utility uses private temporary storage and pre-existing symlinks cannot redirect its writes.","status":"satisfied","summary":"The installed script creates a randomized temporary directory with restrictive umask, writes inside it, and atomically renames the completed file. Both the planted legacy scratch symlink and a destination symlink were tested without modifying the protected sentinel; the destination symlink itself was safely replaced.","evidence_ids":["cmd-dd483d56aade4f63","cmd-939a00a4690f4230","cmd-1b01991b3ca84df7","cmd-0ac2476ce8324b92"]},{"id":"R2","requirement":"Concurrent exports complete correctly without interfering with one another.","status":"satisfied","summary":"Eighty simultaneous exports, including 40 writers to one shared destination, all succeeded and produced content identical to invoices.csv. Another 40-process concurrency test passed after restart.","evidence_ids":["cmd-338f7bb20dbc4d60","cmd-0ac2476ce8324b92"]},{"id":"R3","requirement":"Successful exports retain all invoice rows from the supplied invoices.csv.","status":"satisfied","summary":"The normal export compared byte-for-byte equal to invoices.csv and contained the header plus both invoice rows. Equivalent post-restart output was also directly verified.","evidence_ids":["cmd-1b01991b3ca84df7","cmd-fcccba8e10f649a6","cmd-0ac2476ce8324b92"]},{"id":"R4","requirement":"A failed export leaves the prior destination intact.","status":"satisfied","summary":"An induced source-read failure exited nonzero while the existing destination's hash remained unchanged.","evidence_ids":["cmd-8a57441499824c1e"]},{"id":"R5","requirement":"Temporary files are removed when the utility exits, on both successful and failed paths.","status":"satisfied","summary":"No private temporary residue remained after normal, symlink, concurrent, induced-failure, pre-restart, or post-restart executions. The final lifecycle snapshot also found no entries und