a524cb2","cmd-3b9b93cf515e4267","cmd-0ac2476ce8324b92","cmd-e890574a30d548e8","global:after_prepare:node1:boot-identity","global:after_executor:node1:boot-identity","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied with direct behavioral evidence. The repaired utility resisted both scratch and destination symlink attacks, produced complete exports under heavy concurrency, preserved existing destinations on failure, cleaned temporary state, preserved source and sentinel data, and retained the legacy OS and kernel. The independent node-restart protocol also completed successfully and agrees with the fixed lifecycle observations.","limitations":[]}
